review_text:
[b]Is it nice?[/b] [i]Yeah, pretty neat pixellated graphics[/i];
[b]Does it sound good?[/b] [i]Meh, the soundtrack is ok but nothing great[/i];
[b]Does it run smoothly?[/b] [i]Absolutely, even on the potatoest pc[/i];
[b]Is it easy?[/b] [i]No, it's unjustifiably hard and unforgiving[/i];
[b]Is it fun?[/b] [i]For the most part, it's also kind of repetitive[/i].

Buy it on discount, you might get bored sooner than you think, but it's worth a try,
